                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "That is why I was proud to vote today to pass the Affordable Insulin Now Act which caps out-of-pocket costs for insulin at no more than $35 per month in Medicare Part D & commercial health insurance. Every American deserves access to affordable prescription drugs & medicine. 2/2",
